  "preamble": "The Proto-Uralic alveolo-palatal fricative *ś lost its palatal articulation in the daughter branches. Finnic and Hungarian both give a plain sibilant, spelled sz in Hungarian.",
  "phoneticEffects": "Depalatalization",
  "languageExamples": [
